My summer again this year

1021
01:00:40.240 --> 01:00:42.326
I guess I'll be so unlucky

1022
01:01:10.479 --> 01:01:11.897
{\an8}Why did you come back?

1023
01:01:11.980 --> 01:01:13.774
{\an8}Are you finally curious about that?
Shall I tell you?

1024
01:01:13.857 --> 01:01:16.985
{\an8}Baek Do-ha said something
Did you hire a lawyer?

1025
01:01:17.069 --> 01:01:19.113
{\an8}What are the conditions and purpose?

1026
01:01:19.196 --> 01:01:20.489
{\an8} Baek Do-ha
About Song Ha-kyung

1027
01:01:20.572 --> 01:01:22.157
{\an8}I guess you really don't know anything.

1028
01:01:22.241 --> 01:01:24.243
{\an8}Song Ha-kyung, should I give this house to you?

1029
01:01:24.326 --> 01:01:25.327
{\an8}Get out!

1030
01:01:25.411 --> 01:01:26.328
{\an8}Don't come in

1031
01:01:27.746 --> 01:01:29.581
{\an8}2 years ago
A shameless bastard like you

1032
01:01:29.665 --> 01:01:31.041
{\an8}They should have been charged with fraud.

1033
01:01:31.125 --> 01:01:32.918
{\an8} Our 17 years of memories to you

1034
01:01:33.001 --> 01:01:34.378
{\an8}Are these all things that will disappear if you sell your house?

1035
01:01:34.461 --> 01:01:38.090
{\an8}Why are these two like that?
Are you obsessed with peanut restaurants?

1036
01:01:38.173 --> 01:01:41.969
{\an8}I'm terrible!
I'm so sick of it!

1037
01:01:42.052 --> 01:01:45.514
{\an8}Lie
You can't beat me this time

1038
01:01:45.597 --> 01:01:47.725
{\an8}I have no intention of losing to you.

1039
01:01:47.808 --> 01:01:49.101
{\an8} Let’s go somewhere
Let's end it in the mud

1040
01:01:50.310 --> 01:01:52.563
{\an8}That's for us
I think it's a more fitting ending

